    "identifier": "hebi-basilisk-art-adaptive-camouflage",
    "description": "<p>Your coat your body in Chakra, layering it like a serpents scales, before making it reflect light like a mirror. For the duration, you gain a +4 bonus to checks made with the Hide and Sneak actions and you cannot be tracked without the aid of a Jutsu as you leave behind no tracks or traces of your movement.</p>\n<p>Serpent Coil. When you are Hidden from a creature you deal [Weapon Damage] to, you roll your damage twice, keeping the higher result.</p>",
